    "书名和作者用于书架显示、搜索和文字封面，改动不会影响原文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The title and author are used on the shelf, in search and on the lettering cover. Changing them does not touch the file."
